    private CarrierByLocationResDTO getResponseDTO(List<ShippingProfileResponseDTO> shippingProfileResponseDTODefaultList, List<ShippingProfileResponseDTO> shippingProfileResponseDTOCustomList, UserConfigResponseDTO userConfigResponseDTO, String facilityId) {

        CarrierByLocationResDTO responseDTO = CarrierByLocationResDTO.builder()
                .order(new ArrayList<>())
                .defaultOrder(new ArrayList<>())
                .build();
        Map<String, Boolean> accessMap = getAccessMap(userConfigResponseDTO);
        Map<String , AvailableCarrierDTO> availableCarrierDTOMap = new HashMap<>();
        for (String responseKey : ShippingProfileConstants.RESPONSE_CARRIER_KEYS) {
            availableCarrierDTOMap.put(responseKey, new AvailableCarrierDTO());
        }
        mapCustomCarrierList(accessMap, availableCarrierDTOMap, shippingProfileResponseDTOCustomList);
        mapDefaultCarrierList(accessMap, availableCarrierDTOMap, shippingProfileResponseDTODefaultList);
        responseDTO.setCarrier(availableCarrierDTOMap);
        CarrierOrderingEntity carrierOrderingEntity = carrierOrderingRepository.getReferenceByFacilityId(facilityId);
        if (carrierOrderingEntity!=null && carrierOrderingEntity.getCarrierOrder() != null && !carrierOrderingEntity.getCarrierOrder().isEmpty()) {
            responseDTO.setOrder(carrierOrderingEntity.getCarrierOrder());
        }
        removeDisabledCarriers(responseDTO, accessMap);
        addDefaultOrder(responseDTO, accessMap);
        return responseDTO;
    }

    private static void addDefaultOrder(CarrierByLocationResDTO responseDTO, Map<String, Boolean> accessMap) {
        for (String carrier : ShippingProfileConstants.DEFAULT_ORDER) {
            if (Boolean.TRUE.equals(accessMap.get(carrier)) && !responseDTO.getOrder().contains(carrier)) {
                responseDTO.getDefaultOrder().add(carrier);
            }
        }
    }

    private static void removeDisabledCarriers(CarrierByLocationResDTO responseDTO, Map<String, Boolean> accessMap) {
        List<String> filteredOrder = new ArrayList<>(responseDTO.getOrder());
        for (String carrier : ShippingProfileConstants.DEFAULT_ORDER) {
            if (Boolean.FALSE.equals(accessMap.get(carrier))) {
                filteredOrder.remove(carrier);
            }
        }
        responseDTO.setOrder(filteredOrder);
    }

    private void mapDefaultCarrierList(Map<String, Boolean> accessMap, Map<String, AvailableCarrierDTO> availableCarrierDTOMap, List<ShippingProfileResponseDTO> shippingProfileResponseDTODefaultList) {

        for (ShippingProfileResponseDTO shippingProfileResponseDTO : shippingProfileResponseDTODefaultList) {
           String carrier = shippingProfileResponseDTO.getCarrier();
            if (carrier == null) {
                continue;
            }
            carrier = carrier.toLowerCase();
           String responseKey = RESPONSE_KEY_MAPPING.get(carrier);
            if (Boolean.TRUE.equals(accessMap.get(carrier)) && responseKey != null) {
                AvailableCarrierDTO availableCarrierDTO = availableCarrierDTOMap.get(responseKey);
                availableCarrierDTO.getDefaultCarrier().add(shippingProfileResponseDTO);
            }
        }
    }

    private void mapCustomCarrierList(Map<String, Boolean> accessMap, Map<String, AvailableCarrierDTO> availableCarrierDTOMap, List<ShippingProfileResponseDTO> shippingProfileResponseDTOCustomList) {

        for (ShippingProfileResponseDTO shippingProfileResponseDTO : shippingProfileResponseDTOCustomList) {
            String carrier = shippingProfileResponseDTO.getCarrier();
            if (carrier == null) {
                continue;
            }
            carrier = carrier.toLowerCase();
            String responseKey = RESPONSE_KEY_MAPPING.get(carrier);
            if (Boolean.TRUE.equals(accessMap.get(carrier)) && responseKey != null) {
                AvailableCarrierDTO availableCarrierDTO = availableCarrierDTOMap.get(responseKey);
                if (availableCarrierDTO != null) {
                    availableCarrierDTO.getCustomCarrier().add(shippingProfileResponseDTO);
                }
            }
        }
    }

    private Map<String, Boolean> getAccessMap(UserConfigResponseDTO userConfigResponseDTO) {
        boolean isCmsSameDay = false;
        boolean isCmsNextDay = false;
        boolean isCmsSameDayState = false;
        Boolean isCmsAccess = userConfigResponseDTO.getLocation().getCmsConfiguration().getCmsAccess();
        boolean cmsAccess = Boolean.TRUE.equals(isCmsAccess);

        if(cmsAccess) {
            List<String> cmsServiceLevels = userConfigResponseDTO.getLocation().getCmsConfiguration().getCmsServiceLevels();
            isCmsSameDayState = cmsServiceLevels.stream().anyMatch(level -> level.equalsIgnoreCase(OCM_SHIPMENT_TYPE_SAMEDAYSTATE));
            isCmsNextDay = cmsServiceLevels.stream().anyMatch(level -> level.equalsIgnoreCase(OCM_SHIPMENT_TYPE_NEXTDAY));
            isCmsSameDay = cmsServiceLevels.stream().anyMatch(level -> level.equalsIgnoreCase(OCM_SHIPMENT_TYPE_SAMEDAY));
        }

        boolean isFedexAccess = userConfigResponseDTO.getLocation().getFedexConfiguration().getFedexAccess();
        boolean isUspsAccess = userConfigResponseDTO.getLocation().getUspsConfiguration().getUspsAccess();
        boolean isDhlAccess = userConfigResponseDTO.getLocation().getDhlConfiguration() != null &&
                Boolean.TRUE.equals(userConfigResponseDTO.getLocation().getDhlConfiguration().getDhlAccess());
        Map<String, Boolean> accessMap = new HashMap<>();
        accessMap.put(FEDEX, isFedexAccess);
        accessMap.put(USPS, isUspsAccess);
        accessMap.put(CMS_COURIER_SAME_DAY_STATE, isCmsSameDayState);
        accessMap.put(CMS_COURIER_SAME_DAY, isCmsSameDay);
        accessMap.put(CMS_COURIER_NEXT_DAY, isCmsNextDay);
        accessMap.put(DHL, isDhlAccess);
        return accessMap;
    }

