                        .recipientType(SENDER)
                        .build(),
                Notifications.builder()
                        .email("email3@email.com")
                        .recipientType(SENDER)
                        .build());

        Set<ConstraintViolation<TestClass>> violations = validator.validate(new TestClass(notifications));

        assertThat(violations).hasSize(1);
        assertThat(violations.iterator().next().getMessage()).isEqualTo("There should be 5 or fewer unique email addresses for each recipient type");
    }

